<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Geoghegan-Quinn not to seek re-election-RTE radio.</title>
<headline>Geoghegan-Quinn not to seek re-election-RTE radio.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maire Geoghegan-Quinn, health spokeswoman for Ireland's main opposition party Fianna Fail and Galway West's representative in the Irish parliament, will not seek re-election, Irish state radio said on Monday.  </p>
<p>Geoghegan-Quinn had become concerned about media intrusions into her family life, RTE radio said.</p>
<p>Ireland is due to hold a general election by November.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
